#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/lighten.rst:148
msgid "Easy Dodge"
msgstr "Desvio Simples"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/lighten.rst:152
msgid "This blending mode is called \"Easy Dodge\" in English."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/lighten.rst:154
msgid ""
"Aims to solve issues with Color Dodge blending mode by using a formula which "
"falloff is similar to Dodge, but the falloff rate is softer. It is within "
"the range of 0.0f and 1.0f unlike Color Dodge mode."
msgstr ""
"Pretende resolver problemas com o modo de mistura por Desvio de Cor, usando "
"uma fórmula cujo corte é semelhante ao Desvio de Cor, mas com uma taxa mais "
"suave. Está dentro do intervalo de 0,0f e 1,0f, ao contrário do modo de "
"Desvio de Cor."

